    "merchant_description": "\"Subedi Law Office offers legal services to our clients in the Greater Toronto Area. We provide our services in Immigration Law, Real Estate, Commercial closing, Family law, and Will and Estate services, etc. Our Immigration team is second to none which is evidenced by our success in the Refugee Board, Refugee Appeal division, Detention Hearing and Federal Court. With our vast experience, we strive hard to provide the best real estate services to enable our clients to realize their dream home, at affordable legal cost and take all the necessary steps for our client’s smooth transition. We foresee the problems to tackle those issues in advance, thereby we assure our client’s smooth and hassle-free process.\"",
